    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110631" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φήληξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ηκος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a
